### 5. GlobalCache 구현체 (Bean으로 등록)

모든 구현체는 `@Component` 또는 `@Service`로 등록되며 **GlobalCache 인터페이스를 구현**합니다.

#### 5.1 CategoryRepositoryImpl

**파일:** `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound-adapter/proxy/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/outbound_adapter/proxy/category/CategoryRepositoryImpl.kt`

```kotlin
@Component
class CategoryRepositoryImpl(
    private val categoryValkeyRepository: CategoryValkeyRepository,
) : CategoryRepository,
    GlobalCache<Int, CategoryProjection> {

    override fun getAll(ids: Collection<Int>): Map<Int, CategoryProjection?> {
        val values = categoryValkeyRepository.getAll(ids.toList())
        return ids.zip(values).associate {
            it.first to it.second?.toProjection()
        }
    }

    override fun putAll(values: Map<Int, CategoryProjection>) {
        categoryValkeyRepository.putAll(values.map { (_, v) -> v.toEntity() })
    }
}
```

