#### 6.4 통합 사용: CachedProxyApplicationService

**파일:** `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/application/index/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/application/index/service/proxy/CachedProxyApplicationService.kt`

```kotlin
@Service
class CachedProxyApplicationService(
    private val categoryApplicationService: CategoryApplicationService,
    private val brandApplicationService: BrandApplicationService,
    private val manufacturerApplicationService: ManufacturerApplicationService,
    private val mallApplicationService: MallApplicationService,
) {
    fun fetchDependencies(dependencyId: DependencyId): Dependency =
        runBlocking(Dispatchers.IO) {
            val categoriesDeferred =
                async {
                    if (dependencyId.categoryIds.isEmpty()) {
                        emptyMap()
                    } else {
                        categoryApplicationService.getCachedAllByIds(
                            dependencyId.categoryIds
                        )
                    }
                }
            val brandsDeferred =
                async {
                    brandApplicationService.getCachedAllByIds(
                        dependencyId.brandIds
                    )
                }
            // ... 다른 async 작업들

            Dependency(
                categories = categoriesDeferred.await(),
                brands = brandsDeferred.await(),
                manufacturers = manufacturersDeferred.await(),
                malls = mallsDeferred.await(),
            )
        }
}
```

**특징:**
- 코루틴으로 모든 캐시 조회를 병렬로 실행
- 각 캐시는 독립적으로 3단계 캐시 계층 적용

