### 7. GlobalCache 구현의 Valkey 저장소

#### 7.1 CategoryValkeyRepository

**파일:** `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/outbound/repository/cache/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/repository/cache/CategoryValkeyRepository.kt`

```kotlin
@Component
class CategoryValkeyRepository(
    redisTemplate: RedisTemplate<String, String>,
) : AbstractValkeyRepository<Int, CategoryValkeyEntity>(
    redisTemplate = redisTemplate,
    serializer = CategoryValkeyEntity.serializer(),
    keyPrefix = CATEGORY_CACHE_KEY_PREFIX,
) {
    fun getAll(ids: List<Int>): List<CategoryValkeyEntity?> {
        return this.hashMultiGet(ids)  // Redis Hash 조회
    }

    fun putAll(entities: List<CategoryValkeyEntity>) {
        this.hashMultiSet(entities.associateBy { it.id })
    }

    companion object {
        private const val CATEGORY_CACHE_KEY_PREFIX = 
            "commerce-search.search-api.cache.category"
    }
}
```

#### 7.2 MallValkeyRepository

```kotlin
